msgid "OPcache if every installed plugin were active"
msgstr "OPcache, falls alle installierten Plugins aktiv wären"

# machine translation
#: includes/features/class-seoprostack-hosting-needs.php:1702
msgid "OPcache is off, so PHP compiles the site’s code again on every request. Ask your host to turn it on."
msgstr "OPcache ist deaktiviert, daher kompiliert PHP den Code der Website bei jeder Anfrage neu. Bitten Sie Ihren Hosting-Anbieter, OPcache zu aktivieren."

# machine translation
#: includes/features/class-seoprostack-hosting-needs.php:1721 includes/features/class-seoprostack-hosting-needs.php:1737
